  {
   "value": [
    {
     "text": "# Owners\n\nThe ingest pipeline is owned by the Atlas team.",
     "status": "original_english",
     "reason": null,
     "language": "en",
     "model": null,
     "prompt_version": "1",
     "glossary_version": "d2d068ff5886",
     "version": "e1",
     "spans": null,
     "cached": false
    },
    {
     "text": "## Rota\n\nThe Atlas team is on call every Tuesday and handles incidents for everything it owns.",
     "status": "original_english",
     "reason": null,
     "language": "en",
     "model": null,
     "prompt_version": "1",
     "glossary_version": "d2d068ff5886",
     "version": "e1",
     "spans": null,
     "cached": false
    },
    {
     "text": "# Ports\n\nThe search daemon listens on port 8791. The chat server listens on port 8787.",
     "status": "original_english",
     "reason": null,
     "language": "en",
     "model": null,
     "prompt_version": "1",
     "glossary_version": "d2d068ff5886",
     "version": "e1",
     "spans": null,
     "cached": false
    },
    {
     "text": "# One retry budget\n\nRule. A loop shares one deadline, one call count and one token ceiling across all of its steps. A step's own limit never multiplies the total.",
     "status": "original_english",
     "reason": null,
     "language": "en",
     "model": null,
     "prompt_version": "1",
     "glossary_version": "d2d068ff5886",
     "version": "e1",
     "spans": null,
     "cached": false
    },
    {
     "text": "# Decision: translation cache in the checkout\n\nThe translation cache is stored as a SQLite file inside the repository checkout.",
     "status": "original_english",
     "reason": null,
     "language": "en",
     "model": null,
     "prompt_version": "1",
     "glossary_version": "d2d068ff5886",
     "version": "e1",
     "spans": null,
     "cached": false
    },
    {
     "text": "# Decision: translation cache moved\n\nThis supersedes the 2025 cache decision. The translation cache is now stored under the user cache folder, never inside the checkout.",
     "status": "original_english",
     "reason": null,
     "language": "en",
     "model": null,
     "prompt_version": "1",
     "glossary_version": "d2d068ff5886",
     "version": "e1",
     "spans": null,
     "cached": false
    },
    {
     "text": "# Review before merge\n\nRule. Every pull request receives one independent review round before it is merged. The author's own checks are not a review.",
     "status": "original_english",
     "reason": null,
     "language": "en",
     "model": null,
     "prompt_version": "1",
     "glossary_version": "d2d068ff5886",
     "version": "e1",
     "spans": null,
     "cached": false
    },
